              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 5:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ngoma ya Dawidi hatera inzara, imara imyaka itatu ikurikiranye; maze Dawidi aja kubisiguza Uhoraho. Uhoraho arishura, ati Vyātewe n’ubgicanyi bga Sauli n’inzu yiwe, kuko yishe ab’i Gibeyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.9.3+JOS.9.4+JOS.9.5+JOS.9.6+JOS.9.7+JOS.9.8+JOS.9.9+JOS.9.10+JOS.9.11+JOS.9.12+JOS.9.13+JOS.9.14+JOS.9.15+JOS.9.16+JOS.9.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 9:3-17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umwami ahamagaza ab’i Gibeyoni, arabibabgira. (Kand’ ab’i Gibeyoni ntibār’ abo mu Bisirayeli, ariko bār’ abandurutse ku masigarira y’ Abamori; kandi nah’ Abisirayeli bari barasezeranye na bo kubareka, ariko Sauli yari yagomvye kubahonnya, abitewe n’ishaka yagirira Abisirayeli n’Abayuda.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.26.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 26:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi abaza ab’i Gibeyoni, ati Nobakorera iki? Notanga impongano ki, kugira ngo mubone gusabira ishamvu y’Uhoraho umugisha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ab’i Gibeyoni baramwishura, bat’ Ico tugomba kuri Sauli n’ab’ inzu yiwe s’ifeza cank’ izahabu, kandi mu Bisirayeli nta muntu n’umwe tugomba kwica. Na we aravuga, at’ Ico muvuga ni co mbakorera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Babgira umwami, bat’ Umuntu yaturanduye, akaturonderera inama yo kutugeseza, kugira ngo ntitugire uburagamo mu gihugu cose c’ Abisirayeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.25.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Guh 25:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26",
